&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz82zfwz65zkz86zz66zwz73zz76zz79zz73zz85zz89zz88znwumz84zz88z29z76zgz84zz81zb2z122z7&quot;&gt;This is a great role &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz66z704z78zpz67zz75zf5wz66zpurtz86zmpw4z69z2wz87zbiaz88zz79z&quot;&gt;for an individual who is &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz82zfwz65zkz86zz66zwz73zz76zz79zz73zz85zz89zz88znwumz84zz88z29z76zgz84zz81zb2z122z7&quot;&gt;passionate about working with data and data systems, and who love&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz66z704z78zpz67zz75zf5wz66zpurtz86zmpw4z69z2wz87zbiaz88zz79z&quot;&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz82zfwz65zkz86zz66zwz73zz76zz79zz73zz85zz89zz88znwumz84zz88z29z76zgz84zz81zb2z122z7&quot;&gt; solving problems. You’ll have a good sense for when it makes sense to build fast, scrappy solution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz66z704z78zpz67zz75zf5wz66zpurtz86zmpw4z69z2wz87zbiaz88zz79z&quot;&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz82zfwz65zkz86zz66zwz73zz76zz79zz73zz85zz89zz88znwumz84zz88z29z76zgz84zz81zb2z122z7&quot;&gt; to unblock a key stakeholder vs. when to push back or bring in an outside service. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz66z704z78zpz67zz75zf5wz66zpurtz86zmpw4z69z2wz87zbiaz88zz79z&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate will be a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz82zfwz65zkz86zz66zwz73zz76zz79zz73zz85zz89zz88znwumz84zz88z29z76zgz84zz81zb2z122z7&quot;&gt; great communicator who can help coordinate across multiple internal and external teams and take&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz66z704z78zpz67zz75zf5wz66zpurtz86zmpw4z69z2wz