&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz82zfwz65zkz86zz66zwz73zz76zz79zz73zz85zz89zz88znwumz84zz88z29z76zgz84zz81zb2z122z7&quot;&gt;Work with a wide range of cross-functional stakeholders to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvohideyz65zj9pz75zz88zz68zjbz71zcz70zz76z0flz89zz68zyz87zz80zkz72z6&quot;&gt;derive requirements and architect shared datasets; ability to document, simplify and explain complex problems to different types of audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
