&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz82zfwz65zkz86zz66zwz73zz76zz79zz73zz85zz89zz88znwumz84zz88z29z76zgz84zz81zb2z122z7&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Snowflake, dbt, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvohideyz65zj9pz75zz88zz68zjbz71zcz70zz76z0flz89zz68zyz87zz80zkz72z6&quot;&gt;Dagster, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz82zfwz65zkz86zz66zwz73zz76zz79zz73zz85zz89zz88znwumz84zz88z29z76zgz84zz81zb2z122z7&quot;&gt;and ETL/reverse ETL tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz66z704z78zpz67zz75zf5wz66zpurtz86zmpw4z69z2wz87zbiaz88zz79z&quot;&gt;Excellent judgment and creative problem solving skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
